    "core": "QuerySession owns checked source/context binding, full owner/base/draft, explicit resume, a single prepare token, independent user restriction and the exact native application receipt. No editor URI or native API is used in core.",
    "rpc": "Optional querySessions capability for API 1.15. XML sessionOpen publishes an initial v1 checkpoint, restore is paused, owner/base update only after checked native receipt and successful checkpoint CAS. Generic recovery may update only the active session draft.",
