    "newDependencies": false,
    "publicProtocol": "API minor 1.15 adds opt-in session methods; API 1.14 recovery and 1.13 query extraction/planning remain available.",
    "preparedRecoveryLimit": "The exact pending output and applied draft are currently memory-only. The original full owner/base and latest acknowledged draft survive; the latest draft can differ from the draft being applied. A durable prepared intent is required before production client migration."
